            "A": "Build on the fastest measured candidate (5.416 ms): retain compact adjacency, first-match ID resolution, preselected successors, and memoized iterative path evaluation. Test one isolated refinement, such as lazy successor selection cached only for nodes reached from requested roots versus eager preselection. Measure end-to-end and preserve input order, tie behavior, missing-ID handling, and float accumulation order.",
