            "analysis": "The baseline measured 12.027 ms. The strongest observed improvement is A's compact graph representation, one-time ID resolution and successor selection, and memoized iterative evaluation at 5.416 ms (about 2.22x baseline); a sorted-map alternative measured 5.706 ms. The measured packed-scan and OpenMP/SIMD variants were slower, so prioritize refining the winning sequential approach and treat parallelism as conditional. Measurements alone do not establish correctness: every final candidate and integrated result must remain correct for all valid inputs."
