          "plan": {
            "A": "Research a faster, general-purpose byte-radix path building on the best measured candidate (0.01107 s). Reduce memory traffic or skip provably uniform byte passes where beneficial, while preserving strcmp ordering for every valid record, including duplicates and variable-length strings supported by the format. Audit buffer ownership and output; benchmark rather than assuming these changes help.",
